      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "The quoting process was a breeze. Had been referred by my folks, they were impressed with the components/price but mostly felt comfortable with the salesman.Small business, but does heaps of installs.Their quote was comparable to others but the components were better, and the warranty as good.The install was seamless, and they made extra efforts to conceal a power cable along the side of the house that was hard to do given the other cabling/air con unit etc.They didn’t leave a single bit of mess, and were polite and helpful.The paperwork and emails that would come through afterwards for grid connection were all explained, and I didn’t have to do anything.I didn’t have Wi-Fi at the time, so couldn’t hook up an app to see the energy production. A year later I called Bryce and he went out of his way to drop in and set it up on my phone. You just don’t get that sort of service these days. Bravo.And thanks again",
